OL,3,GNEWSASpecial powers to be used ahead of
OL,4,Aderby match
OL,5,
OL,6,FDispersal orders will be put in place
OL,7,Fin Oxford, Didcot and Reading ahead of
OL,8,FOxford United and Reading's match on
OL,9,FWednesday.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police (TVP) said its
OL,12,Foperation will be "highly visible and
OL,13,Fcomprehensive" before and after the
OL,14,FLeague One match at the Kassam Stadium
OL,15,Ffrom 19:45 GMT.
OL,17,FIt said officers will be given special
OL,18,Fpowers to tell people to leave areas in
OL,19,FOxford city centre, Blackbird Leys and
OL,20,Fnear Didcot Parkway and Reading rail
OL,21,Fstations.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
