OL,3,GNEWSASpecial powers to be used ahead of
OL,4,Aderby match
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey will be in force from 11:00 on
OL,7,FWednesday until 01:00 on Thursday and
OL,8,FTVP said it has worked closely with the
OL,9,Ftwo clubs and British Transport Police
OL,10,Fon the plans.
